# Decision

We link the **Desktop Modeler** directly to the **Build Agent** using the ZIP-based API.

When a build is triggered from the Modeler:
1. All model files are automatically bundled into a ZIP archive;  
2. The Modeler requests a **temporary build token** from the License Management backend;  
3. The ZIP archive and metadata are sent to the Build Agent via HTTP POST;  
4. The Modeler displays build progress (queued, running, done).

This architecture makes the collaboration between Modeler and Build Agent **transparent, efficient, and fully automated**.
